        "subject": "Duplicate Candidates Detected",
        "html": "=<h2>🚨 Duplicate Candidates Detected</h2>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Total candidates checked:</strong> {{ $json.total_candidates }}<br>\n<strong>Duplicates found:</strong> {{ $json.duplicates_found }}<br>\n<strong>New candidates:</strong> {{ $json.new_candidates.length }}\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>Duplicate Candidates</h3>\n\n{{ $json.duplicates.map((d, i) => `\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\n  <strong>${i + 1}. ${d.candidate_name}</strong><br>\n  Email: ${d.candidate_email}<br>\n  Phone: ${d.candidate_phone ?? \"Not provided\"}<br><br>\n\n  <strong>Matched Database Record</strong><br>\n  Person ID: ${d.matched_person_id}<br>\n  Name: ${d.matched_name}<br>\n  Email: ${d.matched_email}<br>\n  Phone: ${d.matched_phone ?? \"Not provided\"}\n</div>\n`).join(\"\") }}\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>Please review these candidates before adding them to the system.</p>",
